    "xtu_rich_content_e4i7PF": {
      "type": "xtu-rich-content",
      "blocks": {
        "paragraph_LLX6Rj": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Lightweight everyday protection with easy access to camera controls and flexible mounting for any adventure.",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 22,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_7qtUd3": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Designed for XTU S7 Pro/S7 Pro Max</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "richtext_QhRLdF": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>This protective frame is designed specifically for the<a href=\"/products/xtu-s7-pro-4k-action-camera\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"XTU S7 Pro 4K Action Camera | 50FPS, AI ISP, Super 5.0 Stabilization, Wi-Fi 6 & 360° Horizon Lock\"> XTU S7 Pro</a> and<a href=\"/products/xtu-s7-pro-max-action-camera\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"XTU S7 Pro Max 4K50FPS HDR Action Camera | 1/1.28&quot; RYYB Sensor 50MP, AI ISP & 14-Stop Dynamic Range\"> S7 Pro Max</a> action cameras. It helps keep the camera securely mounted during vlogging, travel, cycling, motorcycle riding, hiking, and everyday outdoor recording.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_YGBbdQ": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ACC-04.jpg",
            "media_ratio": "21 / 9",
            "alt": "",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_YNjjqN": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Lightweight Open-Frame Protection</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "richtext_wMJDYd": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>Made from lightweight plastic, the open cage helps protect the camera body from everyday scratches and light bumps without adding unnecessary bulk. Weighing only 29 g, it keeps your camera setup compact and easy to carry.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_dmRJMK": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Easy Access to Camera Controls</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "paragraph_HLtm3A": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "The open-frame design maintains convenient access to the camera screen, lens, buttons, microphones, and side connection areas. You can operate the camera and connect compatible accessories without repeatedly removing the frame.\n\nThe open structure also allows better airflow around the camera during extended recording.",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_7pNYeD": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Built-In Bottom Mount Adapter</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "richtext_bxxgpd": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>The integrated bottom adapter allows the camera to connect to compatible tripods, selfie sticks, handlebar mounts, helmet mounts, chest mounts, and other action-camera accessories.</p><p>Before recording, make sure the camera is correctly positioned and that the frame, mounting screw, and external mount are fully secured.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_nfycYk": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Ideal for a Wide Range of Activities</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "richtext_kngPrF": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>Suitable for:</p><ul><li>Vlogging and travel videos</li><li>Cycling and motorcycle riding</li><li>Hiking and walking tours</li><li>Helmet and chest-mounted recording</li><li>Tripod and selfie-stick recording</li><li>Everyday content creation</li></ul><p><strong>Important:</strong> This is an open protective frame and is not waterproof. Use a compatible waterproof housing whenever the camera may be exposed to rain, splashes, or underwater conditions.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_dafnPi": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Package Contents</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "richtext_bExXhr": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<ul><li>1 × Protective Frame for XTU S7 Pro/S7 Pro Max</li><li>1 × Integrated Bottom Mount Adapter</li></ul><p><strong>Please Note:</strong> The camera, mounting screw, tripod, selfie stick, and other accessories are not included unless otherwise stated.</p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_3ECzBp": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Installation and Sealing Guide</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "image_KxEX3H": {
          "type": "video",
          "settings": {
            "video_source": "youtube",
            "video_url": "https://youtu.be/yNkIsCej9Hk",
            "media_ratio": "16 / 9",
            "alt": "Installation and sealing guide",
            "image_width": 100,
            "align": "center",
            "image_radius": 16,
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "richtext_pQmd6A": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<h4><strong>Complete Your XTU S7 Pro Setup</strong></h4>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 12,
            "spacing_mobile": 8
          }
        },
        "richtext_XAwEjX": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "body": "<p>This package includes the protective frame with bottom mount adapter only. The action camera and other mounting accessories are sold separately.</p><p><a href=\"/products/xtu-s7-pro-4k-action-camera\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"XTU S7 Pro 4K Action Camera | 50FPS, AI ISP, Super 5.0 Stabilization, Wi-Fi 6 & 360° Horizon Lock\">Purchase the XTU S7 Pro Action Camera</a></p><p><a href=\"/collections/action-camera-accessories\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Action Camera Accessories\">Explore XTU Action Camera Accessories</a></p>",
            "align": "left",
            "font_size": 18,
            "font_size_mobile": 14,
            "text_color": "#333333",
            "spacing": 24,
            "spacing_mobile": 16
          }
        },
        "image_LHkVyq": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ACC-02_3969d0c1-f31f-482a-a8ce-5031fe40cc63.jpg",
